The corpus in data/corpus/ consists of structured metadata and original
short summaries derived from publicly accessible case notes at
hklandlaw.wordpress.com. Source URLs are retained on every record; no source
text is reproduced. Follow the source's own terms for any use of the
underlying posts.

The persuasive index in data/persuasive.json (built by
scripts/build_persuasive.py from data/sources/uklr/) consists of structured
metadata, links and original classifications derived from the machine-readable
splits and case pages at uklawreference.com. Source page URLs are retained on
every record; no source prose is reproduced. Every record is marked
verified="unverified" and hk_status="persuasive-only" by construction. Follow
the source's own terms for any use beyond this index.
